Bundle-Name: Eclipse Fennec OSGi MCP Endpoint
Bundle-Description: The client half of the MCP whiteboard: an addressable MCP server \
 (name + URL) and a configuration-only publisher for one hosted elsewhere. Depends on \
 OSGi alone — a consumer that only has to reach an MCP server never deploys the MCP SDK.

-workingset: mcp

-buildpath: \
	org.osgi.annotation.versioning;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.service.component.annotations;version=latest,\
	org.osgi.service.metatype.annotations;version=latest

-testpath: assertj-core
